# 📡️ REAL binary op frame. Ticket 26/08/10/ARTIFACT-SYSTEM-OVERHAUL-REAL-CODECS-RUNTIME-REUSE-EVOLUTION:
# replaces the prior literal-JSON `serde_json::to_vec`/`from_slice` shortcut (`../../🦀️component.rs`'s
# old `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op` — the LAST standard-specific `POLICY_STDIO_JSON_TRANSFER_BAN`
# violation named anywhere in this program's own census) AND the old ABNF placeholder this file used
# to contain. `Ifc2x3Mutation` is a genuine data-carrying enum whose variants embed
# `Part21Instance`/`Part21Header`/`Ifc2x3Snapshot` (itself embedding `Part21Value`, a self-recursive
# data-carrying enum via `List`/`Typed`) — no `DslField` impl exists or can exist (blanket impls
# cover only ints/bool/String/Vec<T where T: DslField>/BTreeMap/[T;N]/DslValue/Wire, never a
# data-carrying enum), so the generic `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout
# (`pack_rt::encode_record_body`/`dsl::variants_binary::encode_op`, both requiring a `RecordSpec`
# derived FROM a `DslField` impl) genuinely does not fit — same structural blocker `4`'s own
# `IfcMutation` doc comment cites.
#
# Handcrafted instead: `format u8` (`store::OP_BINARY_FORMAT` convention) + `tag u8` (the
# `Ifc2x3Mutation` variant ordinal, same 0-4 order `parse_ifc2x3_mutation`'s own keyword match uses)
# as two REAL fixed fields, then the variant's own id/instance/header/snapshot payload as one
# trailing `bytes` chain. Every flat field (`id`) IS real field-by-field binary at the Rust layer
# (`enc_part21_instance_bin`/`enc_part21_header_bin`/`write_str_bin` in `../../🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs`,
# reused here, plus this file's own `enc_ifc2x3_snapshot_bin`) — only `Part21Value::List`/`Typed`'s
# self-recursion into `Vec<Part21Value>` cannot be re-modeled field-by-field AT THIS DIALECT LAYER,
# because `Prim::Ref` (the only construct that could describe that self-recursion here)
# unconditionally errors during `walk_protocol` (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`, recipe §5 — confirmed
# unchanged through every FG-wave pilot, not fixed by this wave either). Same honest-boundary
# treatment the plan prescribes: opaque at the protocol layer, genuinely structured (and
# round-trip-tested) at the Rust layer.
dialect protocol
protocol stdio.ifc.2x3.mutation
version 1
schema stdio.ifc.2x3
start record

framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
